<title>JAPAN: Low interest rate policy keeping prices stable-MOF.</title>
<headline>Low interest rate policy keeping prices stable-MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's policy of keeping interest rates low is helping to stabilise prices, Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka told a parliamentary committee on Friday.  </p>
<p>&quot;The ultra low interest rate policy is contributing to stabilising prices,&quot; Mitsuzuka said.</p>
</text>
